(5. INSTITUTIONAL RECOMMENDATIONS AND CURRICULUM UPGRADES) '
() '
(Based on the empirical findings, the academic senate recommends) '
(immediate adoption of the following core pedagogical protocols) '
(across all affiliated colleges:) '
() '
(- Mandate maximum 10-minute digital video modules with embedded) '
(verification questions.) '
() '
(- Expand teaching assistant allocations to maintain a maximum 1:25) '
(seminar discussion ratio.) '
() '
(- Deploy campus-wide writing labs equipped with individualized) '
(diagnostic feedback specialists.) '
() '
(- Reconfigure physical classroom spaces into collaborative active-) '
(learning pods with movable workstations.) '
() '
(- Require all syllabus documents to publish explicit learning) '
(outcomes linked to professional accreditation guidelines.) '
() '
ET

